<title>CHINA: DBS HK branch to set HK$300 mln FRCD.</title>
<headline>DBS HK branch to set HK$300 mln FRCD.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Development Bank of Singapore Hong Kong Branch has mandated SocGen Asia to arrange a HK$300 million floating rate certificate of deposit issue, bankers said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The facility has a final maturity of three years. The issue was priced at par to float at 22 basis points.</p>
<p>Fees are not available yet.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2847 4039</p>
